    "body": "<!-- Guidelines: https://docs.spacestation14.io/en/getting-started/pr-guideline -->\r\n\r\n## About the PR\r\n<!-- What did you change? -->\r\nTitle. \r\nThere were a number of EntityQueryEnumerators which looked for SolutionManagers even though most Solutions now are not managed. \r\nTo fix I just accelerated some parts of future Solution refactors to take advantage of solutions being prototypes, by moving the components onto the Solution entities themselves. It definitely needs more cleanup but I'll save those for the proper refactor.\r\nHelps with #43726\r\n\r\n## Why / Balance\r\n<!-- Discuss how this would affect game balance or explain why it was changed. Link any relevant discussions or issues. -->\r\nBuge.\r\nWelders are special and should probably use relations or some other system. Really them being reliant on solutions is bad and we should probably have the welder raise an event for fuel consumption rather than what it does now, then relay that event. We should also have an ActiveWelderComponent but that's all out of scope.\r\n\r\n## Technical details\r\n<!-- Summary of code changes for easier review. -->\r\nMade some components which did solution lookups, instead exist on the solution entities themselves.\r\nRemoved unused datafields as a result of this change.\r\n\r\n## Media\r\n<!-- Attach media if the PR makes in-game changes (clothing, items, features, etc).\r\nSmall fixes/refactors are exempt. Media may be used in SS14 progress reports with credit. -->\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n<!-- Confirm the following by placing an X in the brackets without spaces inside (for example: [X] ): -->\r\n- [X] I have read and am following the [Pull Request and Changelog Guidelines](https://docs.spacestation14.com/en/general-development/codebase-info/pull-request-guidelines.html).\r\n- [X] I have added media to this PR or it does not require an in-game showcase.\r\n<!-- You should understand that not following the above may get your PR closed at maintainer’s discretion -->\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n<!-- List any breaking changes, including namespaces, public class/method/field changes, prototype renames; and provide instructions for fixing them.\r\nThis will be posted in #codebase-changes. -->\r\n \n\r\n\n\r\t\t\t \r\n\r\n**Changelog**\r\n<!-- Add a Changelog entry to make players aware of new features or changes that could affect gameplay.\r\nMake sure to read the guidelines and take this Changelog template out of the comment block in order for it to show up.\r\nChangelog must have a :cl: symbol, so the bot recognizes the changes and adds them to the game's changelog. -->\r\n<!--\r\n:cl:\r\n- add: Added fun!\r\n- remove: Removed fun!\r\n- tweak: Changed fun!\r\n- fix: Fixed fun!\r\n-->\r\n:cl:\r\n- fix: Spray effects work again.\r\n- fix: Items that purge solutions now work again.\r\n- fix: Items that regenerate solutions now work again.\r\n- fix: Welders now properly drain fuel.",
